<title>JAPAN: Nagoya Railroad - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nagoya Railroad - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 77.77		vs	   74.19</p>
<p> Operating	   10.25		vs	    7.94</p>
<p> Current		4.45		vs	    2.85</p>
<p> Net		    2.85		vs	    1.96</p>
<p> EPS		    3.55 yen	  vs	    2.46 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    808 million	  vs	 796 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.25 yen	  vs	    2.25 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nagoya Railroad Co Ltd is a railway company based in the Chubu area.</p>
</text>
